{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "054ab77f-e939-8307-a5ce-95779a2cc5d0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:30:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fatima Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:26:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, this is Fatima Vieira. So, basically I manage a rental property and I need to get rid of a couch. And feel free to interrupt me if I'm rambling, I tend to over-explain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I will. Is the couch going out to the curb for pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the plan. Basically the tenant moved out over the weekend and left it, plus a mattress. Both are kind of soaked actually, from the nor'easter, last weekend's, Saturday into Sunday. They were on the porch and the wind pushed the rain right in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. Wet furniture, that happens. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "74 Bellevue Avenue. Up in the Bellevue area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is there a fee for that? Like, for bulk items. That's my main question, basically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk items usually do need to be scheduled with us, and there can be a charge depending on the item. Couches and mattresses are typically in that group. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so I'll have you confirm it when you schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So who do I schedule with, you or someone else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take it down here. Let me get a few details. Is it just the one couch and one mattress?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one couch, one mattress. Oh, and there's a small side table too, basically a wooden one, but I could keep that out if it complicates things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, we can list it. Three items. Is it all sitting outside right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right now it's on the porch. I can move it to the curb the night before, whatever day you give me. I just don't want it out there for a week, because, like, the HOA, well, not an HOA, but the neighbors."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Put it out the evening before, not any earlier. Make sure it's not blocking the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Not blocking the sidewalk. Does the wet matter? Like, is it heavier or do they refuse it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They'll generally take it. Just tell the crew it's wet when you schedule, so I'll note that on the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, thanks. Please note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. Now, the next available pickup for Bellevue looks like later this week, since crews are catching up after the storm. I'll put you down for that and someone will confirm the day and cost. Is this the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:29:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0179. That's the landline at the office, so if I don't pick up, leave a voicemail and I'll call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0179. And it's under Vieira, V-I-E-I-R-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Fatima Vieira."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set, Ms. Vieira. You'll hear back from us to confirm the pickup day and the fee before it happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. That's all I needed. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
